    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Secure shed of circa 344 sq.m/3700 sq.ft on a large site of circa 3/4 of an acre at Derryluskin Fethard. This facility is suitable for many uses and would make an ideal location for a logistics centre or depot due to its central location, located circa 8km from Fethard, circa 13km from Cashel and the M8 Motorway.  This purpose built facility has the benefit of a secure shed of 16m x 21.5m with the added benefit of a secure lock up compound, a compressor with diesel facilities & large hard core yard.  The property has ESB and mains water connected. \r\nViewing strictly by prior appointment."
      },
